    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just a nice way of saying \"try harder,\" isn't it? it doesn't change the fact that the person everyone respected is gone. the thing is, it's not just that i'm sad or \"limiting\" my beliefs. it's that the math doesn't add up anymore. the value of my life was tied to that path, and now that path is closed. there's no logic in trying to force a version of a person to exist when the essence is gone. it's like trying to breathe in a vacuum. it just doesn't make sense to carry on the performance when the stage is empty.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
